<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Relatório Executivo — Absoluta Medical</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #0d1117;
    --ink2: #1c2630;
    --teal: #00b8a9;
    --teal-dim: #007a73;
    --amber: #f5a623;
    --rose: #e05c5c;
    --green: #3ecf8e;
    --paper: #f4f6f9;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --muted: #6b7a90;
    --border: #e2e8f0;
    --shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  header {
    background: var(--ink2);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .header-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 48px 32px 40px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .header-blob {
    position: absolute;
    top: -60px; right: -80px;
    width: 380px; height: 380px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,184,169,0.18) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  header h1 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  header h1 span { color: var(--teal); }
  header .subtitle {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .header-badge {
    background: rgba(0,184,169,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,169,0.4);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--teal);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ── NAV TABS ── */
  .nav-wrap {
    background: var(--ink);
    sticky: top;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    position: sticky;
  }
  .nav-tabs {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 0 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .nav-tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .tab-btn {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .tab-btn.active, .tab-btn:hover {
    color: var(--teal);
    border-bottom-color: var(--teal);
  }

  /* ── SECTIONS ── */
  .section { display: none; }
  .section.active { display: block; }

  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 36px 24px;
  }

  /* ── SECTION TITLE ── */
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .section-title span { color: var(--teal); }
  .section-desc {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  /* ── KPI CARDS ── */
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .kpi-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px 20px 18px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--border);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.15s;
  }
  .kpi-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .kpi-card.positive { border-top-color: var(--green); }
  .kpi-card.negative { border-top-color: var(--rose); }
  .kpi-card.neutral  { border-top-color: var(--amber); }
  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .kpi-value {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .kpi-meta {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .kpi-delta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 6px;
    padding: 2px 9px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .kpi-delta.up   { background: rgba(62,207,142,0.12); color: var(--green); }
  .kpi-delta.down { background: rgba(224,92,92,0.12); color: var(--rose); }
  .kpi-prev {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ── CHART CARDS ── */
  .chart-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .chart-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .chart-card h3 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .chart-wrap { position: relative; }

  /* ── TOGGLE CONTEXT ── */
  .context-toggle {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .ctx-btn {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 7px 16px;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .ctx-btn.active {
    background: var(--teal);
    border-color: var(--teal);
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* ── COMPARISON TABLE ── */
  .cmp-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  .cmp-table th {
    background: var(--ink2);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .cmp-table td {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .cmp-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .cmp-table tr:hover td { background: rgba(0,184,169,0.04); }
  .badge-up   { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; }
  .badge-down { color: var(--rose); font-weight: 700; }

  /* ── ALERTS / INSIGHT CARDS ── */
  .insight-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .insight-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--border);
  }
  .insight-card.warn  { border-left-color: var(--amber); }
  .insight-card.info  { border-left-color: var(--teal); }
  .insight-card.alert { border-left-color: var(--rose); }
  .insight-card.ok    { border-left-color: var(--green); }
  .insight-icon { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .insight-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .insight-card p { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ── PROGRESS BARS ── */
  .prog-wrap { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .prog-label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .prog-bar {
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .prog-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
  }

  /* ── GAUGE ── */
  .gauge-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  /* ── NR-1 / INFO CARDS ── */
  .info-block {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .info-block h3 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .info-block ul {
    padding-left: 18px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    background: var(--ink2);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .header-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .kpi-value { font-size: 1.35rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HEADER -->
<header>
  <div class="header-blob"></div>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div>
      <h1>Absoluta <span>Medical</span></h1>
      <div class="subtitle">Relatório Executivo — Maio 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Gerado em 28/05/2026</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-badge">📊 Dashboard Gerencial</div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav class="nav-wrap">
  <div class="nav-tabs">
    <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="showTab('vendas',this)">Vendas</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="showTab('evolucao',this)">Evolução</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="showTab('operacional',this)">Operacional</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="showTab('alertas',this)">Alertas & Ações</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="showTab('nr1',this)">NR-1</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
     SEÇÃO 1 — VENDAS
══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="vendas" class="section active">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-title">Faturamento <span>& KPIs</span></div>
  <div class="section-desc">Comparativo Maio 2026 vs Abril 2026 e vs Maio 2025</div>

  <!-- Context Toggle -->
  <div class="context-toggle">
    <button class="ctx-btn active" onclick="setCtx('mes',this)">Maio vs Abril 2026</button>
    <button class="ctx-btn" onclick="setCtx('ano',this)">Maio vs Maio 2025</button>
    <button class="ctx-btn" onclick="setCtx('ytd',this)">Acumulado Jan–Mai</button>
  </div>

  <!-- KPIs dinâmicos -->
  <div class="kpi-grid" id="kpi-grid">
    <!-- preenchido via JS -->
  </div>

  <!-- Gráfico de barras -->
  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-card" style="grid-column: span 2;">
      <h3>Faturamento por contexto (R$)</h3>
      <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chartBarFat" height="90"></canvas></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-card">
      <h3>Quantidade de Pedidos</h3>
      <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chartPedidos" height="200"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-card">
      <h3>Produtos Vendidos vs Ticket Médio (R$)</h3>
      <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chartTicket" height="200"></canvas></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Tabela comparativa -->
  <div class="chart-card" style="margin-bottom:0; overflow-x:auto;">
    <h3>Tabela Comparativa Completa</h3>
    <table class="cmp-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Indicador</th>
          <th>Maio 2026</th>
          <th>Abril 2026</th>
          <th>Δ Mês</th>
          <th>Maio 2025</th>
          <th>Δ Ano</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Faturamento Total</td>
          <td><strong>R$ 210.304,75</strong></td>
          <td>R$ 265.667,28</td>
          <td><span class="badge-down">▼ 21%</span></td>
          <td>R$ 75.425,42</td>
          <td><span class="badge-up">▲ 179%</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Qtd. de Pedidos</td>
          <td><strong>471</strong></td>
          <td>540</td>
          <td><span class="badge-down">▼ 13%</span></td>
          <td>122</td>
          <td><span class="badge-up">▲ 286%</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Produtos Vendidos</td>
          <td><strong>1.261 peças</strong></td>
          <td>1.492</td>
          <td><span class="badge-down">▼ 15%</span></td>
          <td>335</td>
          <td><span class="badge-up">▲ 276%</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Ticket Médio</td>
          <td><strong>R$ 446,51</strong></td>
          <td>R$ 491,98*</td>
          <td><span class="badge-down">▼ 9%</span></td>
          <td>R$ 618,24</td>
          <td><span class="badge-down">▼ 28%</span></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;">* Ticket médio abril calculado a partir de faturamento/pedidos. Dados de maio até dia 28.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
     SEÇÃO 2 — EVOLUÇÃO
══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="evolucao" class="section">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-title">Evolução <span>Jan–Mai 2026</span></div>
  <div class="section-desc">Crescimento acumulado vs mesmo período de 2025</div>

  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card positive">
      <div class="kpi-label">Faturamento Acumulado 2026</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">R$ 979k</div>
      <div class="kpi-delta up">▲ 24% vs 2025</div>
      <div class="kpi-prev">2025: R$ 790.271,74</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card positive">
      <div class="kpi-label">Pedidos Acumulados 2026</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">2.381</div>
      <div class="kpi-delta up">▲ 67% vs 2025</div>
      <div class="kpi-prev">2025: 1.425 pedidos</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card positive">
      <div class="kpi-label">Produtos Vendidos 2026</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">6.364</div>
      <div class="kpi-delta up">▲ 69% vs 2025</div>
      <div class="kpi-prev">2025: 3.776 peças</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card negative">
      <div class="kpi-label">Ticket Médio 2026</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">R$ 411,43</div>
      <div class="kpi-delta down">▼ 26% vs 2025</div>
      <div class="kpi-prev">2025: R$ 554,58</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-card" style="grid-column: span 2;">
      <h3>Faturamento Mensal Estimado — 2026 (R$ mil)</h3>
      <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chartLine" height="90"></canvas></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-card">
      <h3>Crescimento YoY por Métrica</h3>
      <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chartRadar" height="220"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-card">
      <h3>Comparativo Jan–Mai: 2025 vs 2026</h3>
      <div class="prog-wrap" style="margin-top:8px;">
        <div class="prog-label"><span>Faturamento</span><span>+24%</span></div>
        <div class="prog-bar"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:24%;background:var(--teal)"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-wrap">
        <div class="prog-label"><span>Pedidos</span><span>+67%</span></div>
        <div class="prog-bar"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:67%;background:var(--green)"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-wrap">
        <div class="prog-label"><span>Produtos Vendidos</span><span>+69%</span></div>
        <div class="prog-bar"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:69%;background:var(--green)"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-wrap">
        <div class="prog-label"><span>Ticket Médio</span><span style="color:var(--rose)">−26%</span></div>
        <div class="prog-bar"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:26%;background:var(--rose)"></div></div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:20px;font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--muted);">
        ⚡ Volume cresceu fortemente, porém o ticket médio caiu 26%, sinalizando mix de produtos ou política de preços que merece atenção.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
     SEÇÃO 3 — OPERACIONAL
══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="operacional" class="section">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-title">Pontos <span>Operacionais</span></div>
  <div class="section-desc">Reforma, Importação e Atendimento IA</div>

  <!-- Atendimento IA -->
  <div class="section-title" style="font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:4px;">🤖 Atendimento via IA</div>
  <div class="kpi-grid" style="margin-bottom:28px;">
    <div class="kpi-card positive">
      <div class="kpi-label">Resolução via IA — 1ª Semana</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">60%</div>
      <div class="kpi-delta up">↑ Em melhora</div>
      <div class="kpi-prev">Atendimentos resolvidos sem humano</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card neutral">
      <div class="kpi-label">2ª Semana</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">Em análise</div>
      <div class="kpi-meta">Consulte o link de referência</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card neutral">
      <div class="kpi-label">3ª Semana</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">Em fechamento</div>
      <div class="kpi-meta">Dados parciais</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-card">
      <h3>Eficiência IA por Semana (%)</h3>
      <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chartIA" height="200"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-card">
      <h3>Reforma — Pontos de Atenção</h3>
      <div class="insight-grid" style="margin:0;grid-template-columns:1fr;">
        <div class="insight-card warn">
          <div class="insight-icon">🏗️</div>
          <h4>Data de Início</h4>
          <p>Aguardando confirmação para adequação do ambiente e realocação de produtos ao estoque.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-card info">
          <div class="insight-icon">📦</div>
          <h4>Logística Interna</h4>
          <p>Itens precisarão ser transferidos para o estoque. Escritório provavelmente precisará de mesas adicionais.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-card info">
          <div class="insight-icon">📣</div>
          <h4>Comunicação com Clientes</h4>
          <p>Definir se clientes serão informados e se entregas continuarão normalmente durante a reforma.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Importação -->
  <div class="info-block" style="margin-top:8px;">
    <h3>🌐 Importação — Análise de Custo</h3>
    <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
    <table class="cmp-table" style="margin-top:4px;">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Lote</th>
          <th>Unidades</th>
          <th>Custo Unitário Est.</th>
          <th>Observação</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Lote Atual (analisado)</td>
          <td>2.000</td>
          <td>≈ similar ao nacional</td>
          <td>Margem comprometida</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Lote Intermediário 🔍</td>
          <td>~5.000</td>
          <td>A calcular</td>
          <td><strong>Sugestão: calcular este ponto</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Lote Máximo</td>
          <td>10.000</td>
          <td>Maior economia de escala</td>
          <td>Capital imobilizado alto</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--muted);">💡 Recomenda-se simulação de custo para o volume intermediário (≈5.000 un.) a fim de identificar o ponto de equilíbrio entre capital de giro e ganho de escala.</p>
  </div>

</div>
